{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>To The Skies</strong> is a fast-paced aerial racing game where you fly your surfboard through spectacular environments, chaining tricks and carving tight turns to build boost and flow.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Race!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2930600/extras/5a6197c6da5da75c0081449c150516b5.poster.avif?t=1754344740\" width=616 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2930600/extras/5a6197c6da5da75c0081449c150516b5.webm?t=1754344740\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2930600/extras/5a6197c6da5da75c0081449c150516b5.mp4?t=1754344740\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inspired by arcade greats like <i>Wipeout</i>, <i>SSX Tricky</i>, and <i>Pilotwings</i>, <i>To The Skies</i> blends high-speed racing with expressive movement. Each course challenges you to master the skies \u2014 from sunlit cloudscapes to stormy cityscapes \u2014 with dynamic obstacles, branching paths, and opportunities for big-air stunts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Tricks!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2930600/extras/bbd1f916c6536c2542b4dc0c194a7477.poster.avif?t=1754344740\" width=616 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2930600/extras/bbd1f916c6536c2542b4dc0c194a7477.webm?t=1754344740\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2930600/extras/bbd1f916c6536c2542b4dc0c194a7477.mp4?t=1754344740\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Perform spins, flips, and board grabs to regain boost.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Special Moves</strong>! </h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2930600/extras/ccb6419f40e248a628ba317de0f7dd5f.poster.avif?t=1754344740\" width=616 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2930600/extras/ccb6419f40e248a628ba317de0f7dd5f.webm?t=1754344740\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2930600/extras/ccb6419f40e248a628ba317de0f7dd5f.mp4?t=1754344740\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Master unique tricks like 180s to navigate faster and open up new lines.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfc1 <strong>Campaign Mode</strong>:Take on skill-based challenges to unlock new courses, tricks, board upgrades, and cosmetics.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfb5 <strong>Dynamic Soundtrack</strong>: A high-energy soundtrack that evolves with your speed and flow.<br><br>\ud83c\udf10 <strong>Global Leaderboards</strong>: Climb the ranks by hitting perfect runs, optimizing routes, and pulling off risky tricks.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Release:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>To The Skies</i> is currently in development, targeting an early 2026 release. Follow to stay updated on development progress, playtest invites, and future announcements.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2930600?t=1754344740","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2930600?t=1754344740","capsule_image":"ht