lobal Leaderboards</strong>: Climb the ranks by hitting perfect runs, optimizing routes, and pulling off risky tricks.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Release:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>To The Skies</i> is currently in development, targeting an early 2026 release. Follow to stay updated on development progress, playtest invites, and future announcements.</p>","developers":["Clear Skies Interactive"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Racing","id":"9"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2930600/98f9b3bdf4d5eafcdeb7c1b3b1de0c66ed47e720/header.jpg?t=1754344740","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2930600/122409053/7b0a78f8236deeedcd43636602051b32ba275539/1750889917/dash_av1.mpd?t=1749121316","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2930600/122409053/7b0a78f8236deeedcd43636602051b32ba275539/1750889917/dash_h264.mpd?t=1749121316","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2930600/122409053/7b0a78f8236deeedcd43636602051b32ba275539/1750889917/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1749121316","id":257151544,"mp4":{"480":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257151544/movie480.mp4?t=1749121316","max":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257151544/movie_max.mp4?t=1749121316"},"name":"TrailerV2","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257151544/57453bf2b55a6e7238fe2a61a39191ec25ab66ed/movie_600x337.jpg?t